# The team duelist's gun (TGUN, BENCH-TG1; Leigh's strategy doc "Hadur: Team & Melee, the structural shift to
# 1st", 2026-11-04; team thread "Make team members fight as duelists"). Team only: duel and melee fixtures
# replay bit for bit.
# Why it should win: pc-team-mirror (PR #569) has OgiTeam and HadurTeam on the same teams and seeds. Against
# the mid 14 Ogi hits 20.0% to our 16.4% and against the rest 33.4% to 24.3%, so its rounds end a third
# sooner and its members are under fire a third less. Ogi's gun is a play-it-forward kNN pooled by enemy
# class over all five members' scans. DUELGUN gives each member Hadur's duel guns (the GF kNN, the
# anti-surfer views and the hybrid, picked by their virtual scores, the guns that hit simple movers best in
# 1v1), their views pooled per enemy class from every member's sightings, so they learn from the first round;
# the field gun keeps a target until the duel gun has learned its class. The power, the 1.9 cap and the
# fire lane are unchanged. Cloud smoke (6 teams x 2 seeds from 9100, PR body): +1.1 +- 2.7 share points,
# OgiTeam +6.4. The duel surfer half of the doc (SURF) read -3.7 on the same smoke and is not on this card.
# Leigh's rule (2026-11-03): a pilot stage first. dgpilot reads the first 3 of 12 seeds (25% of the screen)
# on all 46 teams and stops the card unless the projected change is above zero; the results PR opens either way.
#   dgprep   build aa, bb and dgu (tmdgun: DUELGUN on every team)
#   dgbb1    bb vs aa, the 46 teams of team-census46.txt x 3 seeds (base 9300), 10 rounds; dgdg1 the same for dgu
#   dgpilot  dgu's projected change over the pilot (gain less half of bb's, /46), every team needing its 3
#            paired seeds: under 0 opens the results PR and ends the card; a short pilot halts it (rerun)
#   dgbb     bb vs aa, the same 46 teams to 12 seeds (resumes the pilot's 3); dgdg the same for dgu
#   dgscr    the whole screen's verdict: +0.5 APS with the 95% low end above zero, every team needing its 12
#            paired seeds (a short screen halts: rerun)
#   dgpr     results PR after the screen (dgpilot opens it itself when it stops the card)
# Each seed is a pair (the arm and aa): pilot 2 x 46 x 3 x 2 = 552 battles (about 40 min at 12 workers),
# screen to 2,208 (about 2.7 h in all). Every step resumes.
# Stop rules on every battle step (halt): 60 failed battles, no battle in 30 minutes, or 40+ skipped
# turns a battle over the last 100 (the duel guns on five members costing too much CPU).
# The team thread reads claude/pc-team-dgun-results.
#   ./queue.sh run pc-team-dgun        (or  .\queue.ps1 run pc-team-dgun)
# Run it from master (one bench queue at a time):
#   git checkout master && git pull

set OUT = ../docs/bench/local
set T = python3 tools/team_modes.py

dgprep | git checkout -q master && V=$(sed -n 's:.*<robot.release>\(.*\)</robot.release>.*:\1:p' ../hadur-robot/pom.xml) && test -n "$V" && for j in aa bb dgu; do rm -f bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_"$V"$j.jar; done && rm -f ${OUT}/team-dgun-*.md && ./fetch-opponents.sh --set team-census46.txt && bash ./build-ablation.sh aa && bash ./build-ablation.sh bb && bash ./build-ablation.sh tmdgun && mkdir -p work && for a in bb dg; do rm -rf work/team-dgun-"$V"-$a; done && for a in bb1 dg1 bb dg; do sed "s/@V@/$V/g" plans/team-dgun-$a.args > work/team-dgun-$a.args || exit 1; done && for j in aa bb dgu; do test -f bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_"$V"$j.jar || exit 1; done && mvn -q compile
dgbb1  | mvn -q exec:java "-Dexec.args=@work/team-dgun-bb1.args" || test $? -eq 1
  after: dgprep
  watch: battles=276
  stop: fails 60
  stop: stall 30m
  stop: skips 40 over 100
dgdg1  | mvn -q exec:java "-Dexec.args=@work/team-dgun-dg1.args" || test $? -eq 1
  after: dgbb1
  watch: battles=276
  stop: fails 60
  stop: stall 30m
  stop: skips 40 over 100
dgpilot | ${T} gate --report ${OUT}/team-dgun-dg-pilot.md --control ${OUT}/team-dgun-bb-pilot.md --set team-census46.txt --seeds 3 --teams 46 --min-aps 0.5 --stop-below 0.0 --out-md ${OUT}/team-dgun-pilot.md; rc=$?; if [ $rc -eq 3 ]; then bash tools/open_results_pr.sh claude/pc-team-dgun-results "The team duelist's gun (DUELGUN, TGUN) on all 46 teams" $(ls ${OUT}/team-dgun-*.md 2>/dev/null); fi; exit $rc
  after: dgdg1
dgbb   | mvn -q exec:java "-Dexec.args=@work/team-dgun-bb.args" || test $? -eq 1
  after: dgpilot
  watch: battles=1104
  stop: fails 60
  stop: stall 30m
  stop: skips 40 over 100
dgdg   | mvn -q exec:java "-Dexec.args=@work/team-dgun-dg.args" || test $? -eq 1
  after: dgbb
  watch: battles=1104
  stop: fails 60
  stop: stall 30m
  stop: skips 40 over 100
dgscr  | ${T} gate --report ${OUT}/team-dgun-dg.md --control ${OUT}/team-dgun-bb.md --set team-census46.txt --seeds 12 --teams 46 --min-aps 0.5 --out-md ${OUT}/team-dgun-verdict.md
  after: dgdg
dgpr   | bash tools/open_results_pr.sh claude/pc-team-dgun-results "The team duelist's gun (DUELGUN, TGUN) on all 46 teams" $(ls ${OUT}/team-dgun-*.md 2>/dev/null)
  after: dgscr
